      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present an unusual case of a young patient regularly followed in our Chronic Renal Insufficiency ambulatory with the periodicity of 2-3 visits per year--with stabilization of his residual renal function. The patient came to the emergency department declaring abdominal pain but make a diagnosis turned out to be more complicated than we expected."},
